Package: metaZIP
Title: Meta-Analysis of Rare Events with Poisson Mixture Models
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("Zhen", "Zhang", email = "zhangquake1@outlook.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Fits Poisson and zero-inflated Poisson meta-analysis models
    with Gamma baseline rates and fixed or normally distributed log risk
    ratios. Supports independent single-arm studies and paired two-arm
    trials, with maximum likelihood estimation, numerical diagnostics,
    information-based uncertainty estimates, and two real-data examples.
    An explicit historical calculation reproduces the original EUS-FNA
    example with separately labeled spreads and interval limits.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: stats, utils, gaussquad (>= 1.0-3), statmod (>= 1.5.0)
URL: https://github.com/zhangz19/metaZIP
BugReports: https://github.com/zhangz19/metaZIP/issues

